>Can you change your alignment and god?? (if so how?).

That depends on whether you want to do it permanently or temporarily.  If you
want a temporary switch (to pay off a priest, for example), find a helm of
reverse alignment.  As soon as you put one on, you're alignment will change to
lawful if you're chaotic, and chaotic if you're lawful -- if you're neutral,
you can toggle through alignments by taking it on and off.  Of course, it might
be a good idea to make sure it's not cursed before putting it on in the first
place, or you'll be stuck with the other alignment until you can uncurse it.

Now, if you want to convert permanently, you need to find a unicorn of your own
alignment, kill it, and sacrifice it on the altar of the god you want to
convert to.  Be in good shape though, this will destroy your luck for a time.





